  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance on Green Finance for the Climate Finance and Green Economy (CF&amp;GE) Unit of the National Treasury</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The global objective of the Technical Assistance is to improve conditions for actors in Kenya to benefit from financing dedicated for climate action (mitigation and adaptation), preserving biodiversity or other social purposes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The specific objective of the Technical Assistance is to strengthen the technical and institutional capacity of the Climate Finance and Green Economy (CF&amp;GE) Unit in order to facilitate delivery of its key mandates relating to coordination of climate finance actions and financing of green economy in the country. When relevant, the Technical Assistance shall work towards implementing the objectives of the International Platform for Sustainable Finance and/or EU policies and instruments dedicated for the area.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
